  "ProductDetail.text1": "Product Overview",
  "ProductDetail.text2": "Built with carefully selected materials and a composed support system,",
  "ProductDetail.text3": "brings lasting comfort to the room without asking for attention. Every layer is considered to help the body settle naturally and keep the sleep surface calm through the night.",
  "ProductDetail.text4": "Size Information",
  "ProductDetail.text5": "Available in Single 100 × 200 cm, Super Single 120 × 200 cm, Queen 160 × 200 cm, and King 180 × 200 cm. Mattress height and final dimensions may vary slightly by collection.",
  "ProductDetail.text6": "Care Instructions",
  "ProductDetail.text7": "Rotate the mattress every three months, keep the surface dry, and use a breathable mattress protector. Clean gently with a soft vacuum attachment and avoid harsh liquid cleaners.",
  "ProductDetail.text8": "Shipping & Returns",
  "ProductDetail.text9": "Complimentary scheduled delivery is available in selected areas across Indonesia. Inspect your order upon arrival and contact our care team within seven days if an item arrives damaged.",
